Bank:
    Simulates a small bank system.
    Tracks deposits, withdrawals, and balances.
    Uses Pandas DataFrame for transactions.
    Can compute total deposits, withdrawals, and final balance.

cgpa:
    Student grade calculator.
    Reads marks/grades and calculates CGPA.
    Uses NumPy arrays for weighted averages.
    Prints per-subject GPA and overall CGPA.

employee salary
    Salary analysis system.
    Reads employee salary details.
    Calculates gross salary, tax deductions, and net pay.
    Can summarize average salary, highest/lowest salary.

retail store:
    Manages store inventory.
    Tracks stock, sales, and revenue.
    Uses Pandas groupby to analyze sales per item/category.
    Helps find best-selling items.

sports
    Sports statistics program.
    Reads match/player performance data.
    Uses Pandas to calculate average score, top scorer, and winning team.
    Can generate summaries of matches.